  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS 10150 FARM+ Global PPG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: FARM+ Global. As described in the project framework document (PFD), this global component aims to increase the adoption of sustainable and climate resilient agricultural practices by unlocking of financial resources, reducing the use of harmful agrochemicals, in a manner that enhance ecosystems health.</narrative>
  </description>
